      {
        "version": "0.1.0",
        "releaseChannel": "STABLE",
        "title": "SDKWork Doctor 0.1.0",
        "summary": "Family private-doctor agent app: patient files, the sdkwork-agents family doctor, a real human-doctor directory, and device-local visit records on four clients.",
        "content": "SDKWork Doctor is a family private-doctor agent application. A household keeps one patient file per member (allergies, chronic conditions, medications, notes) and switches the active patient for the conversation. Exactly three tabs ship on every client: 对话 (the sdkwork-agents family doctor with deterministic emergency-first triage), 医生 (a directory of real human doctors with family-doctor selection and consultation channels), and 我的 (patient files, my doctors, visit records, conversation mode, device checks). The browser surfaces also keep a workbench landing at the surface root. The human-doctor roster is deployment content bound through runtime-env key careDoctorDirectoryUrl, with an authored fallback roster when no directory is configured; the sdkwork-agents agent catalogue proves the managed family-doctor agent is deployed.",
        "highlights": [
          "Three tabs (对话 / 医生 / 我的) on PC, H5, Flutter, and the WeChat mini program",
          "Multiple patient files per household with one active patient for the conversation",
          "Real human-doctor directory with selection, primary doctor, and consultation channels",
          "Doctor employment model: Appbase organization + med_hospital reference per affiliation, full-time / part-time / contract / visiting, multi-site consultation",
          "sdkwork-agents app API integration: session, turn stream, and agent catalogue",
          "Device-local visit records, including human consultations with the doctor recorded",
          "One authored copy contract projected into TypeScript, Dart, and mini program catalogs"
        ],
        "packageIds": [
          "pc-web-browser-standalone-web-url",
          "pc-web-browser-cloud-web-url",
          "h5-browser-standalone-web-url",
          "h5-browser-cloud-web-url",
          "mp-weixin-mini-program-standalone-binary",
          "flutter-ios-standalone-binary",
          "flutter-android-standalone-binary"
        ],
